==German==

===Etymology===
From the association of the form of a face with the form of a [[pancake]].

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n,(e)s,er}}

# {{lb|de|mildly derogatory}} a very flat and broad face; [[pancake]] [[face]] (literal translation)
#: {{ux|de|Die hat voll das '''Pfannkuchengesicht'''!|You have a "pancake face"!}}
# {{lb|de|by extension}} a person with a very flat and broad face; a person with a [[pancake]] [[face]]
#: {{ux|de|He, '''Pfannkuchengesicht'''!}}

